d": "1490569748753781", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830027_1490569752087114_1831031766242235099_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WRTrtnzqk4QQ7kNvwETbXJM&_nc_oc=Adrsr8JQgWdWC4aBJhE9Us8geiyiI7sISueWuVh8DkkoGlxHVsB__Kmvm_B4WFc-6jM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-g6o26THNmb69AwtwRbeXJl7yzNIGXoL2joOz1KdYVKw&oe=6A39396F"}, {"file_name": "F-16C.png", "id": "1553996282252799", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499315359_1553996285586132_7325089630480731356_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1RU3YP_CIqwQ7kNvwHsAX1S&_nc_oc=AdrLcyDj-4KbUuQ74Zg8OUOOpdLjIEErelmdqWhl-YZpwK_trYz2EHaiIlE3spoM2sg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8aIlvyM59OasQ6NJV3pJF4GpsweubJbqsezxwYZhr6tQ&oe=6A392A9A"}, {"file_name": "F-4.png", "id": "659355376764087", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825052_659355380097420_8972992984445569972_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cOFMiT-tv5cQ7kNvwG0tAhD&_nc_oc=AdqniFpE1SzmA_Frso4ONP0T5tnhQRAOGs13whqU0N10CuNekT7h3SvBVBrLagTuNvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af91OfM8ncmLw71IFJlinS16Edwj4NVOzhoofTwjl5w1YA&oe=6A394840"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoPreview.png", "id": "1558640238437455", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_1558640241770788_373292387739959835_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dFnEzVVGPmAQ7kNvwGZHJav&_nc_oc=AdpW_1IFQxEH1sQTVtm_mFVKBiYISSi5sPmT0oMDvillorDq_sHWcLZa4J1Ar20aC-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_AUHIvtp1EMDFRQXa2HuY6Ai-pgtGXg3htvqUpLt002g&oe=6A3937F6"}, "display_name": "AR Planes", "keywords": ["planes", "jets", "flight", "airplane", "flightsim"], "long_description": "Fly 17 legendary U.S. warplanes in mixed-reality or experience them at actual size!  Fire guns, launch missiles, and drop bombs to destroy targets!\n\nAll models are finely-detailed and scaled to 1/48.  They have proportionally-accurate flight characteristics carefully tuned for indoor gameplay (air-density is thick, gravity adjusted, etc.)\n\nPlanes  included:\n\u2022 B-17G Flying Fortress\n\u2022 P-38J Lightning\n\u2022 P-51D Mustang\n\u2022 F4U-1C Corsair\n\u2022 F-86E Sabre\n\u2022 F-4C Phantom II\n\u2022 SR-71A Blackbird\n\u2022 F-14A Tomcat\n\u2022 F-15E Strike Eagle\n\u2022 A-10C Thunderbolt II\n\u2022 F-16C Fighting Falcon\n\u2022 F/A-18F Super Hornet\n\u2022 F-117A Nighthawk\n\u2022 YF-23\n\u2022 F-22 Raptor\n\u2022 F-35A Lightning II\n\u2022 B-21 Raider\n\nControls:\n\u2022 Button A: radial menu\n\u2022 Button B: toggle weapons-mode\n\u2022 Button X: fire guns\n\u2022 Button Y: fire missile/bomb\n\u2022 Trigger: forward thrust\n\u2022 Thumbstick button: afterburner (if available)\n\u2022 Right Thumbstick: (model-scale) plane pitch/roll, (full-scale) move/rotate plane\n\u2022 Left Thumbstick: (model-scale) plane rudder and throttle, (full-scale) move/rotate plane\n\u2022 Grip: (model-scale) grab plane\n\nDestroyable targets are contained within your physical room if you scan it in Quest Environment setup, otherwise a generic space is used.\n\nCheck out \"AR Choppers\" for more MR scale-model flight!", "short_description": "Fly 17 famous U.S. warplanes in mixed-reality or explore them at actual size!  Fire guns, launch missiles, and drop bombs to destroy targets!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroom.space/arplanes/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VROOM", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vroom.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188